<title>RUSSIA: LUKoil says has 52.5 pct stake in Iraqi oil project.</title>
<headline>LUKoil says has 52.5 pct stake in Iraqi oil project.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian leading oil producer LUKoil said on Tuesday it had signed a contract with Iraq and Russia giving it a 52.5 percent stake in the Qurana oil project.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the 23-year project, with a possible five-year extension, would produce 667.3 million tonnes of oil.</p>
</text>
